# Large model/data files (tracked individually by git-lfs or commited manually)
# Keep these tracked:
# data/raw/*.csv        -> tracked
# data/processed/*.csv  -> tracked
# outputs/results/*.json -> tracked
# outputs/figures/*.png  -> tracked
# outputs/models/*.joblib -> tracked (may be large; remove if LFS needed)

# Temporary diagnostic scripts created during development
_*.py
pytest_output.txt
